    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91266" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτῠχ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>slab</i>, in sg. as collective, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαρμάρων πτυχίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procop.Gaz.
					<u>Ecphr.</u>
					p.151B.
				</span></i>
			; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκροστόλιον</span>
			, the part of a ship on which the name was inscribed, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.86
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτύξ</span>
			v.</div>
